":"story_bg/bg/typerbg.png","choice":[]},"58":{"step":[[58,85,""]],"type":5,"name":["信纸","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["<span style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">亲爱的艾格尼丝，我听闻你再次去到圣利济耶，调养身体。</span></span><br><br><span style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">虽然你从不抱怨，在疾病的苦难中，依旧祷念神的恩赐，接受自己作为教徒的磨难。</span></span><br><br><span style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">但我衷心为你祈愿，望圣母的慈爱降临于你，让你的心脏恢复得与常人无异。</span></span><br><br><span style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">你说，神的旨意已为我们安排了一切。我深信不疑，因为我已察觉在我选择的前方，是神在呼唤我。</span></span><br><br><span style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">还有祖母一如既往的宽容与爱，得以让我去到我应去的地方——</span></span><br><br><span style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">我可以去公立中学读书了！望我的喜悦能传达给你，为你减轻皮肉造成的困苦。</span></span><br><br><span style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">这是个好兆头，也许祖母还会支持我在读书之余到裁缝铺当学徒。</span></span><br><br><span style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">说不定一年内，我就能仿照波烈先生的设计，为你缝织一条不再束腰的直筒裙。</span></span><br><br><span style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">这将为我之后去到巴黎成为服装设计师提供莫大帮助……</span></span>","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/bg/typerbg.png","choice":[]},"85":{"step":[[85,86,""]],"type":0,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_6/1_6_bg_bidebaojiazhong.jpg","choice":[]},"67":{"step":[[67,68,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["“巴黎”化作圆月，牵引回忆的潮汐。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"68":{"step":[[68,69,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["她看向窗外，一如既往的阳光不仅